cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset or package, please cite it as below."
title: "bihgrid: the Bosnia and Herzegovina transmission grid as a graph learning dataset"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Dziho
    given-names: Faruk
    email: faruk.dziho@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/FarukDziho/bih-power-data"
url: "https://github.com/FarukDziho/bih-power-data"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - power grid
  - graph neural networks
  - pytorch geometric
  - ENTSO-E
  - Bosnia and Herzegovina
  - benchmark dataset
abstract: >-
  Real >=220 kV transmission topology of Bosnia and Herzegovina (from
  PyPSA-Eur/OSM) joined with 11+ years of hourly ENTSO-E zone-level time
  series (load, generation per type, cross-border flows), packaged as a
  PyTorch Geometric dataset. Data licenses: ENTSO-E Transparency Platform
  terms (time series), ODbL (topology, via OpenStreetMap/PyPSA-Eur).
